# Mandala Mode (optional)

When the user asks for **Mandala Mode**, follow:

1. `mandala-agent-pack/manifests/mandala-mode.yaml` — `when_enabled` / `when_disabled`
2. `mandala-agent-pack/prompts/activate-mandala-mode.txt`
3. Six operational agents in `.cursor/agents/` (fold of 14) — see `docs/governance/cecp/MANDALA_SIX_AGENTS.md`
4. Personality: `mandala-agent-pack/manifests/personality.json`

**Does not** amend `AGENTS.md` or grant write access to protected constitutional paths.
Precedence: role bans > Constitution > Evidence > Personality > Mode lens.
Skill catalogs are checklists — not 312 executable `SKILL.md` files.
